OL,3,GNEWSAResidents invited to shape future
OL,4,Aof road safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being asked for their
OL,7,Fviews on how a local authority can
OL,8,Fimprove its future strategy for road
OL,9,Fsafety.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council has
OL,12,Fstarted a public consultation on its
OL,13,Fdraft road safety strategy, which will
OL,14,Fset out how the Reform UK-controlled
OL,15,Fauthority aims to improve road safety
OL,16,Fup to 2045.
OL,18,FIt will look at ways to reduce deaths
OL,19,Fand serious injuries, and ways to help
OL,20,Fpeople feel safer when walking, riding
OL,21,Fa horse, bicycle or motorcycle, or
OL,22,Fdriving.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
